  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日の仕事はどうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030010,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん、緊張したけど……\r\n甜花なりに……頑張れたと、思う",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n練習の成果が出ていたと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "声はよく出ていたし、ダンスもミスがなかったし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　なんだか甜花、ぼんやりしてるな\r\n疲れてるのか？　いや、何か見て……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ひゃい……！？\r\nあ……ぼ、ぼーっとしてて、ごめんなさい……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こ、こっちこそごめんな、おどろかせて\r\n何か気になるものでもあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そ、その……\r\nあれ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれって……\r\n何かのお店か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……あそこで売ってるスイーツ、美味しいって……\r\nなーちゃんから聞いて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "食べてみたいけど……\r\nいっつも、いっぱい人、並んでて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "人気の店なんだな\r\nでも今は、並んでいないみたいだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……\r\nおやつには、ちょっと遅いから……かな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……せっかくだから行ってみるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "で、でも……事務所に戻るまでが仕事……だよね？\r\nだから、終わってない……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そうか、事務所に帰るまではまだ仕事だと思って、\r\n気軽に寄り道しようと思えなかったんだな）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "一緒に行くか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "じゃあ、買ってこうか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "近くで見てみようか",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030090,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ほ、ほんと？　良いの……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。仕事、頑張ってただろ？\r\nそのご褒美にしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\nプロデューサーさん、ありがと……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お礼を言われることじゃないさ\r\n甜花は、いつも一生懸命に仕事をしているからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nそ、そうかな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、だからこのくらいのご褒美、当たり前だ\r\nよし、じゃあお店に入るか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n甜花……これからもお仕事、頑張るね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030140,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "良いの……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、テイクアウトできるみたいだから\r\n持って帰って、事務所で食べよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！\r\nありがと、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、スイーツ食べて終わりじゃないからな\r\n打ち合わせ、ちゃんとやるんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "わ、わかった……\r\n甜花、ちゃんと頑張る……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、良い意気込みだ\r\nじゃあ、買ってこようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！\r\nあ、プロデューサーさんは、買うの……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺……？\r\nうーん、どうしようかなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "て、甜花……\r\nプロデューサーさんと食べたい、な……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花……\r\nそうだな、せっかくだから、一緒に食べようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！\r\nにへへ、プロデューサーさんと食べるの、楽しみ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
