  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花、こっちにメニューが載ってる看板があるみたいだ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "わぁ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ\r\n甜花、目がきらきらしてるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ど、どれも美味しそうだから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "トッピングまで細かく選べるみたいだな\r\n甜花は、どれが良いんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……マシュマロ……クッキー……\r\nあっ、白玉もある……あうぅ、チョコもいっぱい……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "しゅ、種類が、いっぱいあって……決められない……\r\n……どうしよう……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、こんなに組み合わせがあるんじゃ、\r\n迷うのもしかたないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ご、ごめんなさい……\r\nすぐ、決める、から……えっと、えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ\r\n甜花が決められるまで待ってるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030260,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "待ってて……くれるの……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500403/2015004030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。だから、どれが良いか好きなだけ悩んでいいぞ\r\n決まったら、それを食べよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004030270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……ありがと\r\nにへへ、どれにしようかな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
